{"id":"n55292-1-7","stage":5,"title":"무료하다 · 无聊","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n55292-1-7-1","ko":"이렇게 할 일 없이 지하철을 기다리는 시간은 너무 무료해.","zh":"像这样没事可做，只能等地铁的时间实在太无聊了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이렇게","meaning":"这样","explanation":"이렇다：这样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"이렇다","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71157","senseId":"1","lemma":"이렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"할","meaning":"办理，处置，分配","explanation":"하다：办理，处置，分配；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"13","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"일","meaning":"事，工作","explanation":"일：事，工作","readings":[{"term":"일","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91895","senseId":"5","lemma":"일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"없이","meaning":"没有","explanation":"없이：没有","readings":[{"term":"없이","audio":"/audio/c4b723256abd5d51c1f1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89918","senseId":"6","lemma":"없이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"지하철을","meaning":"地铁","explanation":"지하철：地铁；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"지하철","audio":"/audio/dfb8c73b9f048c3b7e27.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71490","senseId":"1","lemma":"지하철","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"기다리는","meaning":"等，等待","explanation":"기다리다：等，等待；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"기다리다","audio":"/audio/1f9765247406d52d5aaa.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62264","senseId":"1","lemma":"기다리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"시간은","meaning":"时间，空儿","explanation":"시간：时间，空儿；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"시간","audio":"/audio/4692cef5ac69eb37bd53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62841","senseId":"3","lemma":"시간","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"너무","meaning":"太","explanation":"너무：太","readings":[{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28183","senseId":"1","lemma":"너무","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"무료해.","meaning":"无聊","explanation":"무료하다：无聊；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"무료하다","audio":"/audio/76ed17f0ce6f4f1205de.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"55292","senseId":"1","lemma":"무료하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"c2f95cfd19c5a89b","term":"이렇다","zh":"这样","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3","entryId":"71157","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["이러타"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"办理，处置，分配","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"处理事情或问题。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"dfc76879e2f5c3ea","term":"일","zh":"事，工作","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3","entryId":"91895","definition":"需要解决或处理的问题或事项。","pronunciation":["일ː"]},{"id":"c4b723256abd5d51","term":"없이","zh":"没有","audio":"/audio/c4b723256abd5d51c1f1.mp3","entryId":"89918","definition":"不拥有某物或者没有资格或能力的状态。","pronunciation":["업ː씨"]},{"id":"dfb8c73b9f048c3b","term":"지하철","zh":"地铁","audio":"/audio/dfb8c73b9f048c3b7e27.mp3","entryId":"71490","definition":"行驶在地下铁路的电动车。","pronunciation":["지하철"]},{"id":"1f9765247406d52d","term":"기다리다","zh":"等，等待","audio":"/audio/1f9765247406d52d5aaa.mp3","entryId":"62264","definition":"直到人、时机到来或某事完成为止，一直打发时间。","pronunciation":["기다리다"]},{"id":"4692cef5ac69eb37","term":"시간","zh":"时间，空儿","audio":"/audio/4692cef5ac69eb37bd53.mp3","entryId":"62841","definition":"做某事的空闲。","pronunciation":["시간"]},{"id":"b039867287707963","term":"너무","zh":"太","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3","entryId":"28183","definition":"已超过一定的程度或限度的状态。","pronunciation":["너무"]},{"id":"76ed17f0ce6f4f12","term":"무료하다","zh":"无聊","audio":"/audio/76ed17f0ce6f4f1205de.mp3","entryId":"55292","definition":"没有兴趣或热情，感觉枯燥乏味。","pronunciation":["무료하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/3df2e6c95f1ee0edf5e2.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n55292-1-7-2","ko":"그럼 책이라도 읽는 게 어때?","zh":"那读本书怎么样？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그럼","meaning":"那么，既然那样","explanation":"그럼：那么，既然那样","readings":[{"term":"그럼","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60346","senseId":"2","lemma":"그럼","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"책이라도","meaning":"书，书籍，画册","explanation":"책：书，书籍，画册；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；라도：表示让步或假定：“即使是、就算是”。","readings":[{"term":"책","audio":"/audio/ba928dd573a2db9e7579.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71468","senseId":"1","lemma":"책","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"읽는","meaning":"阅读","explanation":"읽다：阅读；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"읽다","audio":"/audio/f843025cff483034e05a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68752","senseId":"2","lemma":"읽다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"게","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어때?","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"86f87d3fb9919f14","term":"그럼","zh":"那么，既然那样","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3","entryId":"60346","definition":"用于表示接受前文内容，或以前文为基础，提出新的主张。","pronunciation":["그럼"]},{"id":"ba928dd573a2db9e","term":"책","zh":"书，书籍，画册","audio":"/audio/ba928dd573a2db9e7579.mp3","entryId":"71468","definition":"把文章或画印刷之后装订成册而成的物品。","pronunciation":["책"]},{"id":"f843025cff483034","term":"읽다","zh":"阅读","audio":"/audio/f843025cff483034e05a.mp3","entryId":"68752","definition":"看文字了解其意思。","pronunciation":["익따"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]}],"audio":"/audio/44908dfeac31a99cb580.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.396,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=55292","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":162,"sequenceScore":3.2227,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["那读本书怎么样？","像这样没事可做，只能等地铁的时间实在太无聊了。","都这么大了还要去上学，实在让人觉得太难为情了。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["像这样没事可做，只能等地铁的时间实在太无聊了。","都这么大了还要去上学，实在让人觉得太难为情了。","那读本书怎么样？"],"answer":2}]}
